id: grappling
name: Grappling
kind: signature
side: disadvantages
tpCost: -5
requirement: N/A
summary: Only while you are the Grappler of a target.
description: >
  The technique requires you to be holding the target.
text: >
  Grappling: The technique requires you to be holding the target.
  –TP Cost: -5
  –Requirement: N/A
  –Effect: You can only use this Attacking Maneuver if you are currently Grappling at least one of the target(s) of this Attacking Maneuver.

